    "fresco_home_about_fYC6ma": {
      "type": "fresco-home-about",
      "name": "Fresco Home About",
      "settings": {
        "kicker": "",
        "heading": "We turn Fresh Harvests into reliable superior quality products.",
        "content": "<p>Fresco Flavors is the in-house freeze-dried organic herbs brand of Freezedry Harvest EPZ Kenya Ltd, one of Africa's leading freeze-drying facilities. We grow our own herbs and specialty ingredients in over 14 acres of our organic farms in Kenya.</p><p>Every crop is carefully tended, harvested at peak ripeness, and delivered to our Freezedry Harvest facility within hours – preserving the integrity of every herb. This enables us to deliver premium farm-to-table products to the world in a format that is stable, convenient, and uncompromising in quality beyond fresh.</p><p>We lock in the flavor so those once-elusive dishes can now be enjoyed everyday, the result? Rich, aromatic herbs directly to your kitchen. By perfectly freeze-drying, we offer you extended shelf-life and guarantee a year-round supply and culinary convenience right at your fingertips.</p>",
        "button_text": "More About Us",
        "button_link": "shopify://pages/about"
      }
    },
